<title>ITALY: Italian Feb car registrations fell 7.5 pct in Aug.</title>
<headline>Italian Feb car registrations fell 7.5 pct in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian new car registrations fell 7.5 percent to 74,000 units in August, compared with August 1995 when 80,000 units were registered, the Ministry of Transport said.</p>
<p>No further data was yet available.</p>
</text>
